        <mxCell id="mobilenetv2-34" value="&lt;b&gt;Key points for viva&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; Depthwise separable convolution (3&amp;times;3 depthwise + 1&amp;times;1 pointwise) gives far fewer parameters and FLOPs than a normal conv.&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; Inverted residual: the skip connects the thin (bottleneck) ends, and the middle is expanded &amp;times;6; the last 1&amp;times;1 is linear so information is not lost.&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; &amp;asymp; 2.3 M parameters with n_classes = 43." style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;fontSize=12;fillColor=#fffbe6;strokeColor=#d6b656;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="575" width="1100" height="150" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
