        <mxCell id="efficientnetb0-37" value="&lt;b&gt;Key points for viva&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; Compound scaling: depth, width and resolution are scaled together with one coefficient; B0 is the baseline network found by NAS.&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; MBConv = MobileNetV2 inverted residual + Squeeze-and-Excitation (learns which channels matter) + SiLU activation.&lt;br&gt;&amp;bull; &amp;asymp; 4.1 M parameters with n_classes = 43." style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;fontSize=12;fillColor=#fffbe6;strokeColor=#d6b656;" vertex="1" parent="1">
